#: ../../source/deployment/cluster/single_node_cluster_deployment.md:5
#: 39971f8e9d61403d9650a9dbc698b753
msgid ""
"There are many types of roles in the cluster mode of DingoDB, such as "
"coordinator, executor, dingo-store, and the cluster mode requires at least "
"three machines. The architecture view can refer [dingo-deploy-architecture]"
"(https://dingodb.readthedocs.io/en/latest/deployment/"
"deploy_on_cluster_by_ansible.html)."
msgstr ""
"在集群模式下，DingoDB 有多种类型的角色，如 coordinator、executor、dingo-"
"store，集群模式至少需要三台机器。架构视图可参考 [dingo-deploy-architecture]"
"(https://dingodb.readthedocs.io/en/latest/deployment/"
"deploy_on_cluster_by_ansible.html)。"

#: ../../source/deployment/cluster/single_node_cluster_deployment.md:8
